## 6. Firebase Architecture

### 6.1 Cloud Firestore — Struktur Koleksi

```text
users/{userId}
skills/{skillId}
user_skills/{userSkillId}
requests/{requestId}
sessions/{sessionId}
messages/{messageId}
reviews/{reviewId}
```

Semua koleksi berada di **root level** (bukan nested/subcollection) supaya query lintas data (misalnya cari semua `user_skills` dengan `type: teach`) tetap mudah dengan Firestore query + index.

### 6.2 Index yang Dibutuhkan

Karena matching butuh filter kombinasi (`skill_id` + `type`), buat composite index:

```text
Collection: user_skills
Fields: skill_id (Ascending), type (Ascending)

Collection: requests
Fields: receiver_id (Ascending), status (Ascending), created_at (Descending)

Collection: sessions
Fields: teacher_id / learner_id (Ascending), status (Ascending), date (Ascending)
```

### 6.3 Firestore Security Rules (Outline)

```javascript
rules_version = '2';
service cloud.firestore {
  match /databases/{database}/documents {

    match /users/{userId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow write: if request.auth != null && request.auth.uid == userId;
    }

    match /user_skills/{docId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow write: if request.auth != null
                    && request.resource.data.user_id == request.auth.uid;
    }

    match /requests/{docId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null
                    && (resource.data.sender_id == request.auth.uid
                        || resource.data.receiver_id == request.auth.uid);
      allow create: if request.auth != null
                    && request.resource.data.sender_id == request.auth.uid;
      allow update: if request.auth != null
                    && resource.data.receiver_id == request.auth.uid;
    }

    match /messages/{docId} {
      allow read, write: if request.auth != null
                    && (resource.data.sender_id == request.auth.uid
                        || resource.data.receiver_id == request.auth.uid);
    }

    match /sessions/{docId} {
      allow read, write: if request.auth != null
                    && (resource.data.teacher_id == request.auth.uid
                        || resource.data.learner_id == request.auth.uid);
    }

    match /reviews/{docId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow create: if request.auth != null
                    && request.resource.data.reviewer_id == request.auth.uid;
    }
  }
}
```

> Ini masih outline — perlu disesuaikan lagi saat implementasi (misalnya validasi tipe data, panjang string, dsb).

### 6.4 Firebase Storage

```text
/profile_pictures/{userId}.jpg
```

Rules dasar: hanya pemilik akun yang boleh upload/replace foto miliknya sendiri, semua user login boleh membaca.

